project_details:
Current research opportunities in the lab focus on:

establishing and evaluating long-term biodiversity benchmarks and avian population trends;
understanding the factors that influence bird population fluctuations across time and space;
exploring avian diversity and ecology through bioacoustics, including passive acoustic monitoring in poorly studied yet ecologically interesting situations (e. The lab maintains several extensive long-term datasets and archival sound collections that provide numerous opportunities for innovative research and publication. Projects that build upon these existing resources and align with the lab’s current research priorities are encouraged
